  "bodyHash": "LrCV2LcJYys=",
  "content": "<span>\n<center>  \n\n![神話金屬](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/logo-banner.png)\n\n<section>\n《神話金屬》是一款 Minecraft 模組，核心玩法圍繞著發掘新礦石、將其冶煉成錠與合金，並打造成你最喜愛的工具與盔甲。  \n\n</section>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<section>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/ores-and-metals-banner.png\" alt=\"礦石與金屬\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\">\n\n本模組中的每種礦石都分佈在地下世界的不同區域，甚至在地獄與終界也能找到它們的蹤跡！  \n\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/cave-screenshot.png\" alt=\"精金、秘銀、四重礦、銀礦的洞穴示意圖\" width=\"1000\" height=\"700\">\n\n收集足夠的礦石後，你可以透過熔煉、高溫燒製，或在合金鍛造爐中進行鍛造，將其轉化為精美的金屬或獨特的合金。\n\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/alloy-forgery.png\" alt=\"深板岩合金鍛造爐及其操作介面\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\">\n</section>\n<br>  \n<br>  \n\n<section>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/tools-and-armor-banner.png\" alt=\"工具與盔甲\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\">   \n\n比獄髓更鋒利的劍、能瞬間爆破黑曜石牆的鎬，以及會隨時間成長強化的盔甲——這些都是你能用這些金屬打造出的部分裝備。 \n\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/legendary-banglum-screenshot.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"273\" alt=\"玩家使用傳奇班格魯姆鎬開鑿岩壁\">  \n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/armor-screenshot.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" alt=\"玩家手持聖潔之劍，身穿全套普羅米修斯盔甲\">\n</section>\n\n<section>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals#credits\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/credits-banner.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" alt=\"製作群\" >\n</a>\n\n若沒有眾多參與者的付出，這個專案將無法實現。感謝每一位貢獻者！點擊上方橫幅查看完整的製作群名單。\n\n</section>\n\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/69cKvQWScC \">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/discord-banner.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"93\" alt=\"Wraith Coding Session 的 Discord 宣傳橫幅\">\n</a>\n</center> \n</span>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
